"lines": [
{
"text": "Well, Moab had been collecting rent for eighteen years.",
"start": 4.18,
"end": 7.681
},
{
"text": "Then Ehud came to pay a visit.",
"start": 9.521,
"end": 11.501
},
{
"text": "King Eglon had a summer room, a throne, a fancy door,",
"start": 16.522,
"end": 20.422
},
{
"text": "And folks lined up with tribute like they always had before.",
"start": 21.142,
"end": 24.763
},
{
"text": "Ehud brought the payment, gave the guards a friendly grin,",
"start": 25.723,
"end": 29.223
},
{
"text": "With a double-edged little secret riding on his right-hand hip.",
"start": 29.843,
"end": 33.384
},
{
"text": "He sent the other fellows home, then turned around once more:",
"start": 34.224,
"end": 38.144
},
{
"text": "\"I got a private word for His Majesty,",
"start": 38.524,
"end": 40.604
},
{
"text": "If he'll kindly clear the floor.\"",
"start": 40.744,
"end": 42.265
},
{
"text": "Out went every servant. Up got Eglon from his seat.",
"start": 43.345,
"end": 46.685
},
{
"text": "\"I've got a message from God,\" said Ehud, soft and sweet.",
"start": 47.445,
"end": 51.226
},
{
"text": "His left hand found the dagger. Well, the message landed hard.",
"start": 51.686,
"end": 55.786
},
{
"text": "Then he slipped out past the porch, locked the door, and left the guard.",
"start": 55.926,
"end": 59.927
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! Give the king a little time.",
"start": 60.027,
"end": 64.387
},
{
"text": "That's what the palace boys kept saying",
"start": 64.447,
"end": 66.687
},
{
"text": "While Ehud made the quarry line.",
"start": 66.767,
"end": 68.768
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! Ain't it nice to be polite?",
"start": 68.828,
"end": 73.008
},
{
"text": "They gave him every minute that he needed",
"start": 73.628,
"end": 75.608
},
{
"text": "To get clean out of sight.",
"start": 75.688,
"end": 77.609
},
{
"text": "One guard said, \"He's relieving himself.\"",
"start": 79.329,
"end": 81.469
},
{
"text": "The others said, \"Fair enough.\"",
"start": 81.569,
"end": 82.929
},
{
"text": "Nobody wanted to be the one",
"start": 83.649,
"end": 85.689
},
{
"text": "To interrupt that royal stuff.",
"start": 85.729,
"end": 87.51
},
{
"text": "They waited till it got embarrassing,",
"start": 88.01,
"end": 90.01
},
{
"text": "Then somebody fetched the key.",
"start": 90.07,
"end": 91.71
},
{
"text": "The king was on the floor by then,",
"start": 92.39,
"end": 94.45
},
{
"text": "And Ehud was running free.",
"start": 94.51,
"end": 96.171
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! Give the king a little time.",
"start": 96.291,
"end": 100.611
},
{
"text": "That's what the palace boys kept saying",
"start": 100.671,
"end": 102.891
},
{
"text": "While Ehud made the quarry line.",
"start": 102.991,
"end": 104.992
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! Ain't it nice to be polite?",
"start": 105.052,
"end": 109.292
},
{
"text": "They gave him every minute that he needed",
"start": 109.852,
"end": 111.852
},
{
"text": "To get clean out of sight.",
"start": 111.912,
"end": 113.832
},
{
"text": "Ehud blew the horn on Ephraim's hill,",
"start": 115.593,
"end": 118.293
},
{
"text": "And Israel came down fast.",
"start": 119.913,
"end": 121.713
},
{
"text": "They held the fords against Moab,",
"start": 123.694,
"end": 126.174
},
{
"text": "And the king's long reign was past.",
"start": 126.334,
"end": 128.274
},
{
"text": "The land got eighty quiet years;",
"start": 128.614,
"end": 130.814
},
{
"text": "That's how the chapter tells it.",
"start": 130.854,
"end": 132.595
},
{
"text": "But down at Eglon's palace, I'll bet",
"start": 132.955,
"end": 135.135
},
{
"text": "They still check the door themselves.",
"start": 135.195,
"end": 137.035
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! Give the king a little time.",
"start": 137.955,
"end": 142.316
},
{
"text": "That's what the palace boys kept saying",
"start": 142.376,
"end": 144.636
},
{
"text": "While Ehud made the quarry line.",
"start": 144.696,
"end": 146.716
},
{
"text": "Don't knock, he's busy! That was their mistake:",
"start": 146.756,
"end": 151.157
},
{
"text": "They minded all the king's good manners",
"start": 151.537,
"end": 153.557
},
{
"text": "While Ehud made his break.",
"start": 153.597,
"end": 155.517
},
{
"text": "Next time the king's got a secret meeting,",
"start": 157.697,
"end": 159.938
},
{
"text": "Maybe knock anyway.",
"start": 162.038,
"end": 163.158
}
],
